00:49:24.830 --> 00:49:26.540
These are $5,000 assets.

00:49:26.540 --> 00:49:29.732
They don't know how many they
have, much less where they are.

00:49:29.732 --> 00:49:31.940
So we've got to know where
they are so Wolpert helped

00:49:31.940 --> 00:49:33.440
us put together
some facilities that

00:49:33.440 --> 00:49:39.650
allows the operators to
geolocate the machines

00:49:39.650 --> 00:49:42.770
