So you can see how that can make
an impact when you're trying

00:49:56.950 --> 00:49:59.259
to get to 50 machines in a day.

00:49:59.259 --> 00:50:01.300
And we've got to make it
easy for them to onboard

00:50:01.300 --> 00:50:02.710
and us to onboard the customer.

00:50:02.710 --> 00:50:06.970
I won't bore you with the
