00:50:27.450 --> 00:50:31.710
So once we have the
machines plotted on the map,

00:50:31.710 --> 00:50:35.100
our ERP tools and
our IoT systems

00:50:35.100 --> 00:50:38.310
are able to layer real
time information directly

00:50:38.310 --> 00:50:41.370
