00:50:53.400 --> 00:50:56.400
for them in the machine,
how full the machine is,

00:50:56.400 --> 00:50:59.212
and whether or not the machine
needs other kind of service.

00:50:59.212 --> 00:51:03.630
Now, this relies heavily on
Google's JavaScript's API.

00:51:03.630 --> 00:51:06.960
And once the route is
set, our route operators

00:51:06.960 --> 00:51:09.720
can use the Directions
API to make sure

00:51:09.720 --> 00:51:13.380
