Viv lets us create
relationships directly

00:53:14.980 --> 00:53:18.880
between buyers and
sellers, between consumers

00:53:18.880 --> 00:53:20.090
and operators.

00:53:20.090 --> 00:53:25.880
And it also helps brands deliver
