00:54:58.690 --> 00:55:00.430
We're also, in this
case, constantly

00:55:00.430 --> 00:55:05.230
able to geolocate Viv users that
are walking around the machines

00:55:05.230 --> 00:55:07.420
or walking around the block.

00:55:07.420 --> 00:55:11.740
We're using Bluetooth, or
BLE, to solve the last puzzle

00:55:11.740 --> 00:55:15.370
piece of the equation between
the location of the machine

00:55:15.370 --> 00:55:17.640
and the location of the user.

00:55:17.640 --> 00:55:20.190
We're using it to improve
the location accuracy,

00:55:20.190 --> 00:55:22.020
all these things
place together, we're

00:55:22.020 --> 00:55:24.870
using it to determine the
orientation of machines

00:55:24.870 --> 00:55:26.190
in a machine bank.

00:55:26.190 --> 00:55:28.800
So oftentimes there's
three or four machines

00:55:28.800 --> 00:55:30.660
in the same place.

00:55:30.660 --> 00:55:33.720
And of course, we're using
Bluetooth to also deliver

00:55:33.720 --> 00:55:37.050
the service to consumers.

00:55:37.050 --> 00:55:39.750
From there we're driving
payments directly

00:55:39.750 --> 00:55:42.210
through Android Pay,
all brought to you

00:55:42.210 --> 00:55:46.020
through a combination of
Vagabond's ERP, Wolpert

00:55:46.020 --> 00:55:51.560
engineering, Google Maps API,
and the Viv consumer platform.

00:55:55.120 --> 00:55:58.850
So with powerful tools from
Google, Vagabond has been able,

00:55:58.850 --> 00:56:01.040
and support from
Wolpert, excuse me,

00:56:01.040 --> 00:56:03.350
Vagabond has been able to
revolutionize the consumer

00:56:03.350 --> 00:56:07.310
buying experience with
the Viv consumer platform.

00:56:07.310 --> 00:56:10.370
We have the technology today
to deliver massive profits back

00:56:10.370 --> 00:56:13.300
to small businesses in America.

00:56:13.300 --> 00:56:17.280
And now we can create direct
relationships between buyers,

00:56:17.280 --> 00:56:22.970
sellers, and makers of goods, in
real time at the point of sale

00:56:22.970 --> 00:56:25.110
directly at the purchase.

00:56:25.110 --> 00:56:27.410
All of this put
together enables us

00:56:27.410 --> 00:56:30.620
to expand the footprint of
Google's already very powerful

00:56:30.620 --> 00:56:34.667
advertising platform directly
into the consumer experience

00:56:34.667 --> 00:56:36.500
through the power of
location based services

00:56:36.500 --> 00:56:38.544
and the Internet of Things.

00:56:38.544 --> 00:56:39.960
Thank you very
much for your time.

